ub} lined up in a 3-5-2. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-2-1-4. {T:away:sub} announced a 3-4-3 and attacked in a 4-3-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-2-1-4 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 4-3-3 with the ball, 3-4-2-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (27% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the centre (26% of touches)."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:home:sub} defended higher (back line 27.2 m from goal, against 20.4 m; tournament average: 28.4 m)."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 13,5, contre 28,1 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 29 % et 31 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","9 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","{T:home:Sub} a contre-pressé fort : 28 % de ses pressions tombent dans les 5 s qui suivent une perte (moyenne du tournoi : 21 %)."],"impact":"Beaucoup d'efforts des deux côtés, aucun vainqueur : le pressing a usé les jambes plus que le score."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 13.5, against 28.1 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 29% and 31% won back within 5 s.","9 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Heavy counter-pressing from {T:home:sub}: 28% of pressures come within 5 s of a loss (tournament average: 21%)."],"impact":"Plenty of effort on both sides, no winner: the press wore out legs more than the scoreline."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Deux équipes proches sur l'axe (+0,16 et +0,34) : pas de choc de styles, plutôt un duel de mêmes recet